      "Who is here",
      "<p>Between us there is about forty years of this. Ask for whoever you like, or let us match you.</p>",
      {}
    ],
    [
      "html",
      "",
      "<div class=\"cms-block cms-block-team\" data-count=\"3\"><div class=\"cms-team-grid\"><div class=\"cms-person\"><img class=\"cms-person-photo\" src=\"media/hair-salon-team-1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" data-field=\"person1_photo\"><h3 class=\"cms-person-name\" data-field=\"person1_name\">Rae</h3><p class=\"cms-person-role\" data-field=\"person1_role\">Cutting</p><p class=\"cms-person-bio\" data-field=\"person1_bio\">Precision cuts and anything that needs to look sharp without needing an hour at home.</p></div><div class=\"cms-person\"><img class=\"cms-person-photo\" src=\"media/hair-salon-team-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" data-field=\"person2_photo\"><h3 class=\"cms-person-name\" data-field=\"person2_name\">Dom</h3><p class=\"cms-person-role\" data-field=\"person2_role\">Barbering</p><p class=\"cms-person-bio\" data-field=\"person2_bio\">Clippers, fades and beards. Also the one who chooses the music.</p></div><div class=\"cms-person\"><img class=\"cms-person-photo\" src=\"media/hair-salon-team-3.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" data-field=\"person3_photo\"><h3 class=\"cms-person-name\" data-field=\"person3_name\">Ines</h3><p class=\"cms-person-role\" data-field=\"person3_role\">Colour</p><p class=\"cms-person-bio\" data-field=\"person3_bio\">Balayage and correction work. Will talk you out of a colour that will not last.</p></div></div></div>",
      {}
    ],
    [
      "html",
      "",
      "<div class=\"cms-block cms-block-timeline\" data-style=\"vertical\"><ol class=\"cms-timeline cms-timeline-vertical\"><li class=\"cms-timeline-item\"><span class=\"cms-timeline-when\" data-field=\"step1_when\">Before</span><div class=\"cms-timeline-body\"><h3 data-field=\"step1_title\">We talk first</h3><p data-field=\"step1_text\">Ten minutes with your hair dry, about what you actually do with it on a Tuesday morning.</p></div></li><li class=\"cms-timeline-item\"><span class=\"cms-timeline-when\" data-field=\"step2_when\">During</span><div class=\"cms-timeline-body\"><h3 data-field=\"step2_title\">You get told things</h3><p data-field=\"step2_text\">What we are doing and why, including when what you asked for is not what will suit you.</p></div></li><li class=\"cms-timeline-item\"><span class=\"cms-timeline-when\" data-field=\"step3_when\">After</span><div class=\"cms-timeline-body\"><h3 data-field=\"step3_title\">You can do it yourself</h3><p data-field=\"step3_text\">If it only looks right when we do it, we have cut it wrong. That is the test.</p></div></li></ol></div>",
      {
