      "<div class=\"cms-block cms-block-newsletter\" ><div class=\"cms-newsletter\"><h2 data-field=\"heading\">Cancellations and colour days</h2><p data-field=\"text\">Occasional: last-minute cancellations, and when we run colour clinics with the technicians.</p><form class=\"cms-newsletter-form\" method=\"post\" action=\"/subscribe\"><label class=\"cms-visually-hidden\" for=\"cms-sub-email\">Email address</label><input type=\"email\" id=\"cms-sub-email\" name=\"email\" required placeholder=\"you@example.com\" data-attr-field=\"placeholder\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"cms-action-btn\"><span data-field=\"cta\">Let me know</span></button><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"consent_text\" value=\"Yes, email me about appointments and colour days. Unsubscribe any time.\"><p class=\"cms-newsletter-consent\" data-field=\"consent\">Yes, email me about appointments and colour days. Unsubscribe any time.</p><p class=\"cms-newsletter-howitworks\">We&rsquo;ll email you a link to confirm. Nothing else is sent until you follow it.</p><p class=\"cms-subscribe-note\" data-subscribe-note role=\"status\" hidden></p></form></div></div>",
